@ui @my-articles
Feature: My articles

    @smoke
    Scenario: As a logged in user, I should see my article list or empty state, when I open the Yazılarım page

    Scenario: As a logged in user, I should see my article title on its detail page, when I click an article title in Yazılarım

    Scenario: As a guest, I should see a login or protected empty state without another user's articles, when I open the Yazılarım page

    Scenario: As a logged in user, I should see my article list without horizontal overflow, when I open Yazılarım at 375 pixels
